{title: There Is a Balm in Gilead}
{artist: African American spiritual}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 66}

Chorus
[F]There is a balm in [Bb]Gile[F]ad to [Dm]make the [Gm]wounded [C]whole;
[F]there is a balm in [Bb]Gile[F]ad to [C]heal the sin-sick [F]soul.

Verse 1
Some[F]times I feel dis[C]couraged, and [F]think my work's in [C]vain,
but [F]then the Holy [C]Spirit re[F]vives my [C]soul a[F]gain.
